{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the waters returned, etc.</b> Meaning: the waters that had been present were drawn back and returned to Ocean. And its saying <b>and the waters diminished</b> means: they were diminished of themselves, in the manner of waters swallowing waters (Genesis Rabbah 13). And its saying <b>at the end of a hundred and fifty</b>, etc. means: this matter — that the waters returned and diminished — was at the end of one hundred and fifty days from the onset of the Flood."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:40:06.012133428Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}